<title>BELGIUM: BELGIAN OLOS END OFF HIGHS, EYE U.S. FOR DIRECTION.</title>
<headline>BELGIAN OLOS END OFF HIGHS, EYE U.S. FOR DIRECTION.</headline>
<text>
<p>1515 GMT - Belgian linear bonds end off intra-day highs, as this morning's 2-10 year flattening move stalled by midday. U.S. dollar seen key to mkt direction, data awaited.</p>
<p>*2007 OLO 5.74% (5.78) BE286=, 9 bps over Bunds (9) </p>
<p>*OLO fut +0.07  BGBc1 ; Mark/Bfr 20.6490/10 (65/95)</p>
<p>*3-mo bill 3.51/53% (50/54), 1-wk repo 3.28/31 (33/37) </p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
</text>
